{"seq":2,"slug":"runtime-pose-generation","title":"运行时姿态生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/foundations/runtime-pose-generation","wordCount":1807,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时姿态生成\">运行时姿态生成</h1><p>很多人第一次写 IK 贴地，会发现脚明明算对了落点，结果脚还是穿模——原因不是求解器错，而是 IK 被插在了流水线的错误位置：它在「混合」之前改了姿态，又被后面的混合覆盖掉了。<strong>程序化动画的成败一半在算法，一半在「插在哪一步」</strong>。这一篇就把角色一帧之内从「一堆动画片段」变成「屏幕上一具有姿态的网格」的完整流水线拆开，标出每种程序化技术的正确插入点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一帧之内，角色的「姿态（pose）」要经过一条固定顺序的流水线。姿态本身是什么？它是骨架里<strong>每根骨骼相对其父骨的局部变换</strong>的集合——每根骨骼一个变换，含平移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、旋转四元数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。FK（正向运动学）把这些局部变换沿骨骼层级逐级相乘，得到每根骨骼的世界变换；这是渲染蒙皮真正需要的东西。</p>\n<p>流水线的标准顺序如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入: 状态机/Blend Tree&lt;br/&gt;选出要播的动画片段] --&gt; B[采样 Sample&lt;br/&gt;按时间取每片段的局部姿态]&#10;  B --&gt; C[混合 Blend&lt;br/&gt;按权重融合多个片段]&#10;  C --&gt; D[姿态后处理 Post-Process&lt;br/&gt;程序化层: IK 注视 弹簧骨]&#10;  D --&gt; E[物理 Physics&lt;br/&gt;布偶 主动布偶 PD]&#10;  E --&gt; F[FK 求全局变换]&#10;  F --&gt; G[蒙皮 Skinning&lt;br/&gt;顶点跟随骨骼]&#10;  G --&gt; H[渲染]\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入: 状态机/Blend Tree&lt;br/&gt;选出要播的动画片段] --&gt; B[采样 Sample&lt;br/&gt;按时间取每片段的局部姿态]\n  B --&gt; C[混合 Blend&lt;br/&gt;按权重融合多个片段]\n  C --&gt; D[姿态后处理 Post-Process&lt;br/&gt;程序化层: IK 注视 弹簧骨]\n  D --&gt; E[物理 Physics&lt;br/&gt;布偶 主动布偶 PD]\n  E --&gt; F[FK 求全局变换]\n  F --&gt; G[蒙皮 Skinning&lt;br/&gt;顶点跟随骨骼]\n  G --&gt; H[渲染]</pre><p><strong>绝大多数程序化动画发生在 D 这一步——「混合之后、FK 之前」</strong>。原因很直接：程序化层要修改的是「最终要用的那个姿态」，所以必须等所有美术动画混合完毕、拿到一个确定的基底姿态后再动手；如果插在混合之前（B 与 C 之间），你的修改会被后续混合稀释甚至覆盖。开篇那个「脚穿模」的 bug，根因就是 IK 被错插在混合前。</p>\n<p>下表列出常见程序化技术的正确插入点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>正确插入步骤</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>足部贴地 IK</td>\n<td>D（混合后，物理前）</td>\n<td>要修正最终姿态的脚，须先有完整基底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注视 / 瞄准</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>改的是最终的头/脊椎朝向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹簧骨 / 余韵</td>\n<td>D（且需上一帧状态）</td>\n<td>跟随的是最终姿态的父骨运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布偶 / 主动布偶</td>\n<td>E（物理步）</td>\n<td>由物理引擎接管骨骼模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根运动 Warping</td>\n<td>C 附近（影响位移）</td>\n<td>调的是根骨的位移轨迹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"局部空间-世界空间与变换链\">局部空间、世界空间与变换链</h2><p>要把程序化层插对位置，先得搞清姿态在哪个空间里表示。动画数据存的是<strong>局部空间（local / bone space）</strong>——每根骨骼相对父骨的变换，这样平移整个角色时不必改每根骨骼的数据。但 IK 求解、射线探地、注视目标这些都发生在<strong>世界空间</strong>，因为目标点（地面、敌人）是世界坐标。</p>\n<p>于是程序化层每帧要做空间穿梭。以注视为例：目标在世界空间，要算头骨该转多少，得先把头骨当前的世界朝向求出来（FK 累乘到头骨），在世界空间算出朝向目标的旋转差，再把这个旋转<strong>转回头骨的局部空间</strong>写回姿态，这样它才能跟着父骨（脖子）正确联动。某根骨骼的世界变换是其局部变换与父骨世界变换的复合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mtext>world</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mtext>world</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>parent</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mtext>local</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{world}}^{(i)} = M_{\\text{world}}^{(\\text{parent})} \\cdot M_{\\text{local}}^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">world</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">world</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parent</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 变换矩阵（或等价的 TRS 组合）。这个递推就是 FK 的本质，也是为什么程序化层「读」姿态时常要部分 FK、「写」姿态时要把结果转回局部——空间换算的疏忽是程序化动画第二常见的 bug 源（第一是插错步骤）。</p>\n<p>关于骨骼层级与蒙皮的更底层细节，本 hub 不重复，见动画系统的<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/foundations/skeletal-skinning\">骨骼蒙皮</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一帧之内-求值图与脏标记\">一帧之内：求值图与脏标记</h2><p>现代引擎不会傻乎乎地每帧把整副骨架从头算到尾，而是把上述流水线组织成一张<strong>求值图（evaluation graph）</strong>：节点是采样、混合、IK、注视等操作，边是姿态数据流。UE 的 Animation Blueprint 与 Unity 的 Playable Graph 都是这种结构。程序化层在图里就是一个或几个后处理节点。</p>\n<p>求值图带来两个工程要点。其一是<strong>顺序由连边决定</strong>，你把 IK 节点接在混合节点的输出端，它就自动跑在混合之后——这把「插对位置」从手工保证变成了图结构保证。其二是<strong>可按需跳过</strong>：远处看不清的角色，可以直接断掉它的 IK、弹簧骨节点，省下求解开销，这正是 LOD 降级的实现基础（见<a href=\"../practice/procedural-performance\">程序化动画性能</a>）。</p>\n<p>弹簧骨这类技术还有个特殊性：它是<strong>有状态的</strong>，需要上一帧的位置/速度来积分这一帧。所以它不能只读当前姿态，还得自己维护一份历史状态，且对求值频率敏感——掉帧或可变时间步会直接影响其稳定性，这点在<a href=\"../dynamics/secondary-motion\">二级动态与弹簧骨</a>里详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"程序化层的写入约束-别和表演打架\">程序化层的写入约束：别和表演打架</h2><p>姿态流水线的最后一课是「克制」。程序化层握着「改写最终姿态」的权力，但乱用会毁掉动画师的表演。三条纪律：</p>\n<p>一是<strong>作用范围用遮罩限定</strong>。贴地只该动腿链，注视只该动头与上脊椎，弹簧骨只该动饰物骨——用骨骼遮罩（bone mask）把程序化节点的影响圈死在指定子树，别让它碰其它骨骼。</p>\n<p>二是<strong>介入强度用权重控制</strong>。程序化结果与基底姿态之间用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 做插值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>lerp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>proc</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pose}_{\\text{out}} = \\text{lerp}(\\text{pose}_{\\text{base}},\\ \\text{pose}_{\\text{proc}},\\ \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">proc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 可随状态平滑变化——比如脚离地时把贴地权重降到 0，落地时再升回 1，避免空中乱伸腿。</p>\n<p>三是<strong>择时由动画事件驱动</strong>。用动画通知（animation notify）在特定帧打开/关闭某个程序化节点，让它只在合适的窗口生效。这三条纪律的具体落地，是<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>姿态是「每根骨骼相对父骨的局部变换」的集合；FK 沿层级累乘得到世界变换，供蒙皮使用。</li>\n<li>流水线固定顺序：采样 → 混合 → 程序化后处理（D）→ 物理（E）→ FK → 蒙皮。绝大多数程序化技术插在 D，布偶插在 E。</li>\n<li>插错步骤（如 IK 插在混合前）会被覆盖，是程序化动画最常见的 bug；引擎用求值图的连边把「插对位置」变成结构保证。</li>\n<li>程序化层要在局部空间与世界空间之间穿梭：目标在世界空间，写回要转回局部空间，空间换算疏忽是第二常见 bug。</li>\n<li>弹簧骨等有状态技术依赖上一帧状态、对求值频率敏感。</li>\n<li>写入要克制：遮罩限范围、权重控强度、通知控时机，避免压垮美术表演。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"why-procedural-animation\">为何程序化动画</a>（动机）、<a href=\"procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a>（强度选择）、<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>（遮罩与权重的落地）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/foundations/skeletal-skinning\">动画系统 — 骨骼蒙皮</a>（骨骼层级与顶点蒙皮的底层机制，本篇所依赖的前置）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>流水线与求值图模型参考 Epic UE5.7 Animation Blueprint / Control Rig 文档（dev.epicgames.com）与 Unity Playable Graph / Animation Rigging 文档（docs.unity3d.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运行时姿态生成","id":"运行时姿态生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"局部空间、世界空间与变换链","id":"局部空间-世界空间与变换链"},{"level":2,"text":"一帧之内：求值图与脏标记","id":"一帧之内-求值图与脏标记"},{"level":2,"text":"程序化层的写入约束：别和表演打架","id":"程序化层的写入约束-别和表演打架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何程序化动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/foundations/why-procedural-animation"},"next":{"title":"程序化光谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/foundations/procedural-spectrum"}}